  "implementation": [
    "Existing message attachment admission remains inert embedded formats only, on explicit user expansion. Search reveal cannot start media; remote links remain links.",
    "Image/audio errors render accessible fixed feedback, exact original source/body order remains. Explicit retry replaces one element, gates old node/attempt handlers, and preserves local keyboard focus.",
    "Audio remains native controls/preload none/no autoplay. Exact owned detach pauses and clears src. StrictMode reattach restores only the already-admitted same data URI.",
    "Production CSP adds media-src 'self' data:, preserving its previous same-origin permission and adding only embedded data. No new remote/blob media permission."
  ],
